{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_title", "source_sha256": "f9b5afbb6307fb0df247d72999400acd528939b9a79467e151af7e30bbd394cb", "ja": "開幕　～聖ミリオン武闘祭～", "zh": "开幕　～圣百万武斗祭～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2c37c0e003186c633cb349e431a9766f1ee0ec0d072cff76f58b2f5860cf229f", "ja": "春の心地よい陽気に誘われて、つい道端で昼\n寝をしてしまったプロデューサーが目覚めた\nのは『聖ミリオン女学園』。そういえば自分\nは武闘教師だなどと突然言い出し、姉妹を勝\n利に導くぞと張り切りだしたのでした♪", "zh": "被春日舒适的暖意所诱，制作人竟在路边睡着了，醒来时却发现自己身处\"圣百万女子学园\"。他突然声称自己是武斗教师，并兴致勃勃地表示要带领姐妹们走向胜利♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6b229bd1392433498079bbdf4f9fc3d70cd4e1dba70b34d24c94faa48a213d68", "ja": "ふう。今日は春の陽気って感じだな。風は心地いいし、\nどこからか花の香りも漂ってきて……ふわぁ。", "zh": "呼。今天真是春日暖阳的感觉啊。风很舒服，也不知从哪里飘来了花香……哈啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b0f4e60996e96b53ae90a5dc4ad9c14104bc1f73276bda1577b3c56fb7479a71", "ja": "う～ん、これはジャスミンの香りかな？　それとも\nラベンダー……このあたりに咲いてたっけ……ふわぁ。", "zh": "嗯～，这是茉莉花的香味吗？还是薰衣草……这附近有开着吗……呼啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "681434252c5598e1f0a0c4d456676c642562a7b3136a7be97ff8ffa826395611", "ja": "というか、さっきから猛烈な眠気が……うう、ダメだ。\nどこかで横に……ああもう、ここで……いいか……。", "zh": "话说回来，从刚才开始就困得厉害……呜呜，不行了。\n找个地方躺一下……啊，真是的，就在这里……也行吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1003_se", "source_sha256": "f284251c98cf3e650e131e80e772668a5fe0fdb702b03e7186c90733520b64f6", "ja": "（スヤァ…………）", "zh": "（呼…………）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "3c9dbfee4814fd4b31b175d5d6b023c9afa8e2e48620f23b9814a50cf2fef3a2", "ja": "先生、起きてください！\n生徒のみんなが先生を待ってますよ？", "zh": "老师，请醒醒！\n学生们都在等您呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a48a2376c894393efc1758564420c89dafd73b3099f4f29a514e349fe79c6e1c", "ja": "……ん、んん……青羽さん？　す、すみません！\n昼寝しちゃったみたいで……あれ？　ここは？", "zh": "……嗯、唔……青羽小姐？对、对不起！\n我好像不小心睡着了……咦？这里是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
