{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "3b4199e2f5d4eccc2cdc482c2a2503aa7a5fcb923bad9b31d86b633546a3f7b1", "ja": "指導した生徒たちのセコンドに付くんですよね？\nしっかり応援してあげてくださいっ♪", "zh": "您要担任亲自指导的学生们的助理教练，对吧？\n请好好为他们加油哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "25afa31c6771be5558f6958e832dec9fc6e06c0203233a0365c683c6d829fded", "ja": "え？　セコンドとは一体……？", "zh": "咦？“场边指导”到底是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "869c6e3776ea6de1fc5094cf4505db862e4d6b34ae4b1d4042cf3b11901486e0", "ja": "楚々とした挨拶が、朝露を乗せた葉を揺らす。\nここは乙女たちの集う名門『聖ミリオン女学園』……", "zh": "楚楚动人的问候，摇曳着沾满朝露的叶片。\n这里是少女们齐聚的名门『圣百万女学园』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6f06dbdcf4fc50de0300f9c799826657c2eb9b03df56f66d44e01c341cbe9ee6", "ja": "はっ。この声は音無さん？", "zh": "啊，这个声音是音无小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "4c6a44f6d4c0d90503cf19922f54f525d2205b3c63a2c8df1a9619c84a143c69", "ja": "この学園には、特別な日にだけ行われる、\n秘密の舞踏会がありました。それは……", "zh": "这所学园里，有一场只在特殊日子举行的秘密舞会。那就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "46ae4896bea6c6943b7acb93b9a1db0313094081e20655a981bbefce3318a96a", "ja": "姉妹の絆と誇りを賭けて、互いの美と健康と、\n強靭な肉体を競い合う、百花繚乱の『武・闘・祭』！", "zh": "赌上姐妹的羁绊与荣耀，比试彼此的美貌、健康\n以及强韧肉体的百花缭乱之『武·斗·祭』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "8256a1212ac1c63d42972deaf1aa8873096c142f233a3d48f01e825b0f708dd4", "ja": "その名も！！　『聖ミリオン武闘祭』！！！", "zh": "它的名字就是！！《圣百万武斗祭》！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "4deaf1883cbdb1aca9b905f7448dd1e0f469456aa778dee4b5d6a160759d2deb", "ja": "今、花を冠する姉妹たちが火花を散らす、\n熱き物語（たたかい）が始まります！！", "zh": "现在，头戴鲜花的姐妹们即将擦出火花，炽热的物语（战斗）开始了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c1ea3adf68e88212c6731d966f412b8e72f7ddfb85a3cb9d42e418b628eac6df", "ja": "音無さん、近くにいたんですね……。\nでも、そうだ！　おかげで全てを思い出しました！", "zh": "音无小姐，原来你就在附近啊……。\n不过，对了！多亏了你，我全都想起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a52577199e248022f2b6493b3e760acd10a2c9b3a548d31e64c030c1a9f0773c", "ja": "俺は聖ミリオン女学園に赴任した武闘教師！\n目的は、指導した姉妹を武闘祭で優勝させること！！", "zh": "我是赴任到圣百万女子学院的武斗教师！  \n我的目标是让指导过的姐妹们在武斗祭上夺冠！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "d4952476ffa9cc0b9c500cec66aae42316963c0f2d2f7087014ce9345f705c02", "ja": "正解です、先生！　それでは私も、\n影ナレのお仕事に戻りますね。ごきげんよう♪", "zh": "答对了，老师！那么我也该回去做幕后旁白的工作了。祝您安好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1018_102mis", "source_sha256": "2c6a3098e568ff85f80a1b965653232b9c128452f24fc960c878155349a82042", "ja": "私も、運営とアナウンスのお仕事があるので\nこれで失礼しますね。ごきげんよう♪", "zh": "我还要负责运营和播报的工作，就先失陪了。告辞♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_601_shrimp_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_601_shrimp_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4e5cfaa2464e4c1eabe281ca13f92497f50f6df37817066402e394d54e57ce08", "ja": "うん、昼寝してる場合じゃなかった……！\n待っててくれよ、みんな！　先生もすぐ行くぞ！", "zh": "嗯，现在可不是睡午觉的时候……！\n大家等着我！先生马上就来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
